{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first three terms of a geometric progression are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/4/2c4278a7094674dcd97ea8fb662cc33b1ecc3e9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2}, \\sqrt[3]{2}, \\sqrt[6]{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" />. Find the fourth term.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/b/6db248c25e9e44259c4376bde53a3c11408c18bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\sqrt[7]{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\sqrt[8]{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\sqrt[9]{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\sqrt[10]{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"418\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After rewriting the radicals as fractional exponents, the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/6463291e67ccf28016a3998631e16ab78223f128.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1/2}, 2^{1/3}, 2^{1/6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>The common ratio of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometric_sequence\" title=\"Geometric sequence\">geometric sequence</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b356d6b01261bec3715abef816776eaad43b7fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^{1/3}}{2^{1/2}} = 2^{-1/6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"97\" height=\"40\" />.  Multiplying that by the third term results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43f697cd56b20fb242120d479824db503058069f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^0$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />.  It simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p>Write the terms as powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/f/11f52e835a28105906c899e89b170ec6333685a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1/2},\\quad 2^{1/3},\\quad 2^{1/6}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"22\" />\nTheir exponents decrease by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f34b3cf20be89133434c1a52cb3bbc3342a16664.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />, so the common ratio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/e/a2eeb9578601f9a026647676e3ee76afacbb8ccd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{-1/6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"18\" />. The next exponent is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/4/55467af6d2d047e65310b13c339ae8319e5fee29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac16-\\frac16=0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" />\nand the next term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/3688876ff545b6900b80c429336386b50e4a4326.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^0=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_